To review our reasoning behind each of the roles:

1.	S3 God User: After Friday’s meeting, we discussed promoting me and Allison to God Users for the library’s S3 account. This will ensure we have all of the permissions we are currently using for S3. 
2.	S3 Super User: Similarly, we’ve decided on having Jen and Virginia as S3 Super Users. 
