6.	Lambda Regular User: If we decide to use Lambda to automate bucket policies, we assume OIS and AWS will design the Lambda policy. We would like for some of our users to be able to view the Lambda function for the library to make sure it’s working properly.
7.	IAM God User: As we talked about last Friday, Nancy needs to be able to add users for librarians and freely change roles. By giving her all IAM permissions, she will be able to carry out these necessary tasks. We’ll talk with Truong about confirming what exactly we need for these permissions, and will revise this role where necessary.
8.	AWS Support God User: By assigning all permissions for opening tickets and communicating with AWS Support, all librarians can file cases directly with the support team.

